OL,4,CBoat Kilda recovered off Orkney      W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GA fishing boat that went missing     W5
OL,7,Gnear the Isle of Lewis a month ago   W5
OL,8,Ghas been recovered after it was      W5
OL,9,Gspotted semi-submerged in the North  W5
OL,10,GSea off Orkney.                      W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GThree men were on board the Kilda    W5
OL,13,Gwhen it disappeared on 13 October.   W5
OL,14,                                      W5
OL,15,GThe body of crew member Douglas      W5
OL,16,GCraigie was found by search teams    W5
OL,17,Gthe following day but two other men  W5
OL,18,G- Norman Murray and Murdo Morrison - W5
OL,19,Gremain unaccounted for.              W5
